{"evaluation_id": "EVL-20261113-dfba1b", "session_id": "SESSION-20261113-0d7479", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:00:00Z", "target_hypothesis_id": "HYP-20261112-6e910a", "verdict": "supports", "evidence_type": "primary_source_collision", "summary": "Odling-Smee et al. 2003 は生物が自らの環境を書き換え、その書き換えが後代の選択圧として残る生態的継承を示す。記録は中立な素材ではなく、書き換えられた環境として後代に拘束的に残る。", "compared_against_hypothesis_ids": ["HYP-20261112-668e44"], "spawned_hypothesis_ids": [], "material_ids": ["MAT-20261113-7a8f12"], "note_ids": ["NOTE-20261113-79e824"], "script_command": "python3 tools/belief_state.py --write-map"}
